      "speaker": "shizuku_mother",
      "text": "『四宮寧月』が、あんなどこの馬の骨とも知らない\n下流の人間と同じものを選ぶなんて、あってはならないの",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_eventstory_8_06/adv_voice_eventstory_8_06_055.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_eventstory_8_06/adv_script_eventstory_8_06-Episode/adv_script_eventstory_8_06-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "7a4632aaf9e43ff668d38bec0b1b10c3220b768bfb5cbd6433d3e08ace50a344",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_eventstory_8_06_055.wav",
      "subtitle": "『四宫宁月』怎么能和那些来历不明、\n出身低贱的人选一样的东西呢？这种事是绝对不允许的",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "6bca2d613f31455d91805f3492870912955cbd05ed24e9e4b625817e163e6a4d",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_eventstory_8_06/adv_script_eventstory_8_06-Text/adv_script_eventstory_8_06-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_eventstory_8_06_054",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "adv_voice_eventstory_8_06",
      "speaker": "shizuku_mother",
      "text": "いい？　あなたはクラシック界の神童であり\n音楽家『四宮絃一郎』の娘なのよ",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_eventstory_8_06/adv_voice_eventstory_8_06_054.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_eventstory_8_06/adv_script_eventstory_8_06-Episode/adv_script_eventstory_8_06-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "ff220779f056c305f6ab41fd41d42a0da5fd3ccf946e589b8540c33c585c444d",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_eventstory_8_06_054.wav",
      "subtitle": "听好了，你是古典乐界的神童，\n也是音乐家『四宫弦一郎』的女儿",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "6a56c4ecbb6c2f3c3922fe123acfd0af3db7adcd6a0f7c8b887f5e38daad975d",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_eventstory_8_06/adv_script_eventstory_8_06-Text/adv_script_eventstory_8_06-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_eventstory_8_06_079",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "adv_voice_eventstory_8_06",
      "speaker": "shizuku_mother",
      "text": "ええ、そうなんです。\n自由時間はバルコニーで読書をしているんですのよ",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_eventstory_8_06/adv_voice_eventstory_8_06_079.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_eventstory_8_06/adv_script_eventstory_8_06-Episode/adv_script_eventstory_8_06-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "a2921a696da2793afa1fb2ff88ed2bc9a8f7a10c8eae454ed48866102b662777",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_eventstory_8_06_079.wav",
      "subtitle": "是的，正是这样。\n自由时间她都是在露台上读书的呢",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "916bd5951dadcb44dc62f4b0ac1d196fc983398e1f01eb1f3315683067006fd0",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_eventstory_8_06/adv_script_eventstory_8_06-Text/adv_script_eventstory_8_06-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
