      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "e4c69db63096c4f360ed203ebc2b62996b95f1f729bb53b33e0627dfe39489e1",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_eventstory_8_06_044.wav",
      "subtitle": "裤子是很不错，\n不过妈妈觉得这件更适合宁月哦",
